===== 3. Secret scanning =====
# gitleaks reads the whole git history, not just the working tree,
# because a secret removed in a later commit is still in the history

$ docker run --rm -v "$PWD/..:/repo" zricethezav/gitleaks:v8.21.2 detect --source=/repo --no-banner --redact -v 2>&1 | tail -12
[90m6:49PM[0m [32mINF[0m 24 commits scanned.
[90m6:49PM[0m [32mINF[0m scan completed in 352ms
[90m6:49PM[0m [32mINF[0m no leaks found

===== 4. Container image scanning =====

$ docker build -q -t taskboard-backend:scan ../13_Final_Project_TaskBoard/backend
sha256:3ccad461a590dbf07bf607876458c9f221df3d2b8ea4d940e1e7216e2330bffb
